{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>In a pure place</b> — If it is outside the court, [then] the breast and the thigh you may eat, males and females, for thus it is written: \"every [one who is] pure in your house shall eat it,\" and likewise \"the purchase of silver\" and \"one born in the house,\" and a widow who has returned. And as you eat now, the thigh and the breast shall be yours as a statute, to take it from all the shelamim offerings."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:09:20.034360430Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}